    },
    {
      "item": "4771",
      "depth": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "4776",
      "depth": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Settings tab at the bottom of the AI Engine Rule Block Wizard page, and enter the event name.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          18
        ],
        [
          44,
          71
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Actions tab at the bottom of the AI Engine Rule Block Wizard page:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 7,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          17
        ],
        [
          43,
          70
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Set Action: Select SmartResponse Plugin from the drop-down menu.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ],
        [
          19,
          39
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Parameters: Configure the following settings for each event ID:",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Type: Alarm Field",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Value: Enter the event name.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          5
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Execute SmartResponse Action From section, select a Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) to launch the SmartResponse plugin.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 8,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          40
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save Action.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 9,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          17
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The AI Engine rule is created.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Right-click on the rule, and select Actions > Enable to enable the rule.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 10,
      "strong": [
        [
          36,
          43
        ],
        [
          46,
          52
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Restart AI Engine Servers for the rule to take effect.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 11,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          31
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "To test AD decoys, log in to a decoy AD user account. You can see events triggered on the LogRhythm server and Deception Admin Portal.",
      "depth": 0
    },
